  "definitionSource": "Candidate fluent .from(Counted, f => f.count(m => m.total)).children<Item>(m => m.items, c => c.identifiedBy(i => i.itemId).from(ItemChanged, f => f.usingKey(e => e.itemId)).removedWith(ItemRemoved, r => r.usingKey(e => e.itemId))).removedWith(Removed), with explicit field metadata for typed items and no initial values. Root-first lifecycle; Every packaged-kernel prefix agrees with actual client engine-state and public-read replay; ordinary constructor validation admits only the bounded count-and-typed-children shape.",
